    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφᾰνηφορ-έω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανᾱφ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wear a wreath</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				781
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				352.4
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φοροῦντες καὶ πανηγυρίζοντες</span> Gauthier et Sottas
				<i>Décret trilingue en l' honneur de
				Ptolémée IV</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.66
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. Anon.Hist. (<i><span class="en">
				<u>FGrH</u>
				160
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				p.886J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				90.50
			</span></i> (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), al.: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κιττοῦ στέφανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).192
				</span></i>
			 (Eretria, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>): metaph. of virtue, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦσα πομπεύει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					4.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανηφόρος</span> (signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				695.1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), al.—Also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανοφορέω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i> (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανηφ-</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; τοῦ Ἀπόλλωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					4.263.6
				</span></i>
			 (Panamara, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
